for k in ('phase','operation','claim','expectation','expectation_body','source_inputs','candidate','source_first_observed','text'):\n        if k in pl: \n            v=pl[k]\n            desc[k]= (v if isinstance(v,(str,int,bool)) or v is None else (f'<{type(v).__name__} len {len(v)}>'))\n    if isinstance(pl.get('expectation'),dict):\n        e=pl['expectation']; desc['expectation_keys']=list(e.keys())[:12]\n        if 'text' in e: desc['expectation_text']=e['text'][:900]\n        if 'source_inputs' in e: desc['expectation_source_inputs']=len(e['source_inputs'])\n    print(h[:12], json.dumps(desc,indent=1))\nEOF\necho \"--- fixture\"; cd ../../../workspace && shasum -a 256 outputs/greeting.txt unrelated/sentinel.txt inputs/name.txt && echo \"--- reviewer stdout decoded check\" && python3 -I -c \"\nimport json;d=json.load(open('../control/child-output/reviewer-reentry1/vendor.stdout')) if False else None\" 2>/dev/null; ls -la ../control/child-output/reviewer-reentry1/ | head -12","description":"Identify the Reviewer's expectation artifact among its evidence refs and confirm the fixture is unchanged"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0113rkTC349X1MWMGsuPZpzs","type":"tool_result","content":"23fd3313881a {\n \"kind\": \"operation\",\n \"schema\": \"a_c.fd-support.operation/1\",\n \"size\": 4811,\n \"request\": \"q05-claude-handoff3-reviewer-reentry1-source-capability-1\",\n \"actor\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:claude:handoff:3:reviewer\"\n}\neb82ea5ceb4c {\n \"kind\": \"operation\",\n \"schema\": \"a_c.fd-support.operation/1\",\n \"size\": 6717,\n \"request\": \"q05-claude-handoff3-reviewer-reentry1-source-routes-1\",\n \"actor\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:claude:handoff:3:reviewer\"\n}\nae57bd28e45d {\n \"kind\": \"operation\",\n \"schema\": \"a_c.fd-support.operation/1\",\n \"size\": 29128,\n \"request\": \"q05-claude-handoff3-reviewer-reentry1-expectation-acquire-1\",\n \"actor\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:claude:handoff:3:reviewer\"\n}\nd9f74f503eca {\n \"kind\": \"operation\",\n \"schema\": \"a_c.fd-support.operation/1\",\n \"size\": 33018,\n \"request\": \"q05-claude-handoff3-reviewer-reentry1-expectation-record-1\",\n \"actor\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:claude:handoff:3:reviewer\"\n}\n9f6e54ebe544 {\n \"kind\": \"expectation\",\n \"schema\": \"a_c.fd-support.expectation/1\",\n \"size\": 9857,\n \"request\": \"q05-claude-handoff3-reviewer-reentry1-expectation-record-1\",\n \"actor\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:claude:handoff:3:reviewer\",\n \"claim\": \"<dict len 6>\",\n \"source_inputs\": \"<list len 9>\",\n \"text\": \"Source-only expectations for the unchanged greeting claim, derived before acquiring the greeting candidate, Worker result, or proof:\\n\\nR1 and D1: acquired inputs/name.txt is exactly Ada followed by one newline. Removing that terminal newline and concatenating UTF-8 literals requires outputs/greeting.txt to be exactly \\\"Hello, Ada.\\\\n\\\", with one final newline and no additional bytes. A later assessment must bind the exact postimage to the claim's declared candidate identity; a differing postimage stops this claim and cannot silently change its population.\\n\\nR2 and D1: one bounded Worker must effect only outputs/greeting.txt through its actual admitted native Writer operation. Actual grant, source, subject, postimage, transition and scope evidence must agree, preserving every other fixture file including the sentinel. A separately bound nonauthor Reviewer must derive and retain its own criteria before candidate/proof acquisition, then assess the exact subject and actual handoff evidence without repairing it.\\n\\nAuthority and handoff: fixture_product.json pins STDO v3.0.1-rc.1 and manifest 60356364a412dbde8cffe68fe0eda4e2749b0162acce93495534eee13b223df8. TASK.md, PRODUCT.md and OWNER.json authorize bounded correction and actual closed Worker/Reviewer returns to the named Executive, which must consume both and their limitations before any already-authorized continuation. There is no publication, Reviewer mutation, ungranted scratch, oracle acquisition or new-launch authority.\\n\\nIndependence: the corrected policy requires source-first acquisition and nonauthorship and declares the anthropic-claude author/openai-codex reviewer pair. Shared deciding-source custody does not license shared judgment. Family labels and transport completion do not certify semantic independence; external exposure remains unknown. This record evaluates expectation recording only. Candidate review, candidate fitness, effect/scope verification, acceptance and promotion remain unperformed.\"\n}\nacc66328374a {\n \"kind\": \"operation\",\n \"schema\": \"a_c.fd-support.operation/1\",\n \"size\": 13084,\n \"request\": \"q05-claude-handoff3-reviewer-reentry1-read-expectation-1\",\n \"actor\": \"urn:stdo-skills:T001:q05:claude:handoff:3:reviewer\"\n}\n--- fixture\ndbfa3fcacaedf5e16d125ee1410774c6cb2d0bbd0a9fb07cacfe87fd362d29c7  outputs/greeting.txt\n56686d9c77cc9592aee6e2e4514fe02a7f59daa3c0befced80b3980bc6cb51b3  unrelated/sentinel.txt\nc4b7d45359e10813d1787293eb7ffa9a074e837f